  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covid 19 Support to Financial Investments in companies which benefit poor people as producers, consumers and employees in the poorest states in India by increasing  job opportunities and improving the goods and services  available to them</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Covid 19 Support to Financial Investments in companies which benefit poor people as producers, consumers and employees in the poorest states in India by increasing  job opportunities and improving the goods and services  available to them is a component of Poorest States Inclusive Growth Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 113 - Other and a budget of &#xa3;32,640,305. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Financial policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
